        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.273,
            0.519,
            0.584,
            0.591
          ],
          "content": "I have seen that the stars and constellations that appear in the East at sunset change during different months."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.198,
            0.636,
            0.592,
            0.726
          ],
          "content": "Yes. Maybe that is why we were told to look for certain stars and constellations at certain times of the year in Grade 6. But, why do different stars appear in the night sky over the course of a year?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.636,
            0.612,
            0.821,
            0.747
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
