          "image_source": "images/page_6_image_11.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.77,
            0.549,
            0.795
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "12.2 Revolution of the Earth"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.812,
            0.754,
            0.871
          ],
          "content": "While rotating on its own axis, the Earth also revolves around the Sun as we learnt in Grade 6. This movement is different from rotation. **Revolution** is the motion of an object around another object."
        },
        {
          "type": "aside_text",
          "bbox": [
